{
  "id": "MRK.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Marko 10",
  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nung'wiischooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabeawa Yesu hoowa ak gawa ng'eanyiida Yudeya, ea ghwahita giigheawda eenda Yordani. Gooreemsa eemeetuw headaanyi gicha. Hean gabiissa gooneali buuneeda ng'asheega gicha gawuurji gida eawoojisu sina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweay fuga Farisaayo heeda Yesu ak gwasim nea gwayeesha, “Heapi ghwadoabiiwi gideaba gayghwanung' siida gatmoadaanyi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Deaweedeeda ghayi gooneegwa Musa aneeda gil?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Saawa niny, “Musa ada ghayi gagoaneasa gheata nea gwayi siida dang'waara barawajeanda jea ghwanung'wa gatmoadaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Musa niny ghayi gagooneegwa gheadi nea gweagu hang'ooynacheeka jeesingeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba gidaghayi sibwata ng'eanyiida, gwasin ‘ASEETA ng'eedeeda ea gatmooda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Asi aba deascheani Siida gaygwaheeli ghwaan ea ghaamwat ak gaygoodeayi sea gatmoadaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu asiyeenyean gayghoah siyagi.’ Asi fiisu mudea fih iyeenya gil niiw siyagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi fuga niroochi ASEETA adagooheeli sih.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gabiikta gicha gah ghoanyaash giinealanga iiteaba ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha, “Siida nung'usa heeda gatmoadaanyi ak ghaghi nuut goodiiysa gatmoadaanyi aba mealuuleega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasunu eara Gatmooda nung'wa heeda siyeadaanyi ak gawa gheemba siinuut gatmooni gamealuul.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoadaw diibiga manang'i ghawooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gweadu buuneeda diibiga manang'i heeda Yesu ghoang'waay iheenga, ak goowoowsa giinealanga buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah Yesu gissin ginealangaaschi gwanyareeksa ak gwayeesha, “Anung'waada diibiga ghapka heedeanyu adoakghuumnyi, aba gideaba Gheambalmeeda ASEETA gammiisa fuga uurji suh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa Gearukuneegwa gideaba siida mamwasta ng'asheega ASEETA baleanda mwanang' siisi maygawa jeedeaba Gheambalmeani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Ghwadeapta diibiga ak gabeashsa geatingaaschi ak ghoang'waanyaada iheenga, ak ghoadawaada ghawooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida was meanang'ocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eat Yesu nea gaygawa bareanyeakaaschi, gafaju sih ama hidu gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Ea Giinealshoocheanda waam, ak gaydasin naaha iijeadanyas eaweega manda muudeanooda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu, “Ghwasaan inyas giguureewean siida Waam? Siida waam geaghus ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Digheanyeeka ginali, ‘Adimealuuli, adinuusi siida, adijagwadiischi, adinabayi ng'uyeega, adireenganayi siida, sisiina mureeda gweanu ea geamadu.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Siidida, “Ea Giinealshoocheanda, diigheanyeeksu miighanyi danaawa eara ghayi aba jeepcheanduumeedeanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goong'weersa Yesu siidida nea nibwariiy ak gwayeesha, “Ghwashoadeaweey gilagi, una ak gishaaydi haleanjeadaang'u indeawi sean amahit gigeanu lapiyeedida ak giidawaadi fuga barbari. Abeeda gaynyasa baruureega aba humng'eeda. Hit ginyuunyi eani geeshteanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy Siidida ng'asheanji gafu duwunda ak ghang'eat gawa nea nigiisan, nea gwasin gideaba abeeda siidida meanang'ocheanda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasach ghaat Yesu gang'ula ginealangaaschi ak gwayeesha, “Ghamneawa ghoanali gidahang'waayda beata jea gaweay meanang'oodiga jeeda Gheambalmeeda ASEETA!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy giinealanga ng'asheanji ghahamng'eanyi. Nea Yesu niny gabiikta ak gwayeesha, “Ea diibigeasu ghamneawa ghoanali gidahang'waayda beata jeeda Gheambalmeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beata jea gawa meanang'ocheanda jeeda Gheambalmeeda ASEETA ahang'waay ea ghang'wana eara beata jea gwasik ngamiya gheang'da sidageeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba deascheani ghahamng'eanyi giinealanga muuchi. Goonyeari geat nea gwayi, “Abeeda iisunu gwanda siichea ghaghu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu saawa nea gang'ula gheanyanga nyaawa, “Huumwa gil aba siida mwadaagha ng'asheanji maygwaroochi. Nea aba ASEETA nih ea miigili. ASEETA manda gichea gwadilna.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Betaro ak gwayeesha, “Ama aseasa? Ang'wearda sinung'wi heeda haleanjeedeanya sean ak geeyeadu geashtaang'u!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa, Siida wassean nung'usa heeda gheeda, ghana orjooga ghaamwat ghana haweega ghaamwat, ghana ghaamwat, ghana ghwaan, ghana diibiga, ghana madameega aba badaydeanyu ea Giijasta miy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba damani bea ghamneawean, gajeataw niba bughala, ea ghwanaawa damani bea ghamneawean gheeda, ea orjooga ghaamwat, haweega ghaamwat, ghaamwat, diibiga, ea madameega ea sawanadeeda ama damanda jea ghwahidu gayghwanyas eaweega manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu fuga saang'a mida madeedeaba suurja, gaygahuydeana sean. Nea fuga saang'a huuydeanayi, iimuchu gayghoah fugeaba mwadi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabiikta deaba samwagu gabaloola miyeeda ea duunoadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda nea gwanda naweeda Yesu sea ginealangaaschi nea gagal Yerusalemu, nea abeeda goosheedeawa Yesu saawa. Ghang'ut ginealangaaschi muuwda nea eara fuga aat geeshta ea ning'ut muuwda. Ghwasach Yesu gicha fugiga atamaniyeenya was giinealangaaschiin, ak gabiissa gwarukusa ng'asheega jea ghwanyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Heapi oaleaydiit! Ghamneawa Geeweayi Yerusalemu. Nea aba hoowa Orjeeda Siida gajeayiin geatinga ashoohoodiga hees ea giinealshoodiga diineeda Yahudi. Fiisu gayghoahaakta eenuus ak geayiin geatinga fuga eemoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwajuuga, nea goong'uriisa ng'usheega nea geabwar aba mughoowooda ak gwanuus. Amadu eaweeteaba samwagu gaygwaduudu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidamus Yakobo ea Yohana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay geaba Yakobo ea Yohana was orjooga Sebedayo ama hita heeda Yesu gwayeesha, “Ea Giinealshoocheanda, gwanda gili sigasayi eemuseey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Googasayi dasinneegwa naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Saawa ak gwayeesha, “Eaniyean nung' goobiida siyagi meatkweadaang'u bea geatinda dugwa, nea goobiida niirja meatkweadaang'u bea geatinda ghaadaam eaweeda siikghaambiidaneey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Agooga eara gidaghamneawa oomuschi moanali! Heapi ghoamuuschi aleayda bayookteanyu bea sawanadeeda? Ama giibaatiisandida jea eebaatiisanan aniini agooga gajeepaatiisaneegwa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Saawa Yesu, “Ea geamuuschi.” Gwayeesha Yesu, “Huumwa gil gikoombeeyda jea daleayda eara agooga ghoamuuschi gideaba gajaleayda Eara giibaatiisandida jea eebaatiisananiin gajeepaatiisananeegwa eara agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajea ng'eaha siida jea goobiida meatkweedeanyu bea geatinda dugwa, ghana meatkweedeanyu bea geatinda ghaadaam. Nih mii gadiyeedeanyu jea dasin gil, geaghus eataw fuga ghayi bay gwararsa ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy giinealanga suurja atamanamughuush gwanyareesi iidaah gissin Yakobo ea Yohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguursa Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Ghoanali gideaba fugiga sighay gili sugoodiga eemoojigean iissa ghoahaaghwiida fuga nyaawa uurda, nea fiisu heesiin iissa goombal fuga nyaawa gharbeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuku agooga ea mii gichea awuurjeewana. Aba siida gasa hawunda aba jeedeang'wa doawa siideang'wa bea gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida gasa ghang'ata mwadi gayghoah soomjeanda buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Orjeeda Siida ghayi moani eegadiyeesa. Ghayi ghoan niny gagadiiyeesa buuneeda nea ghoan gabeagu eaweagaaschi aba giitinooda fuga saang'a.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap siida ng'oaw siguura Bartimayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geahita mujiineeda Yeriko, iidu ghang'eat Yesu sea ginealangaaschi ghabeawa hoowa nea goodeayi eemeetuw. Geanyasa gheata naweeda siisi ng'oaw musiisachi siguura Bartimayo was orjeeda Dimayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iiy gideaba ghang'ata Yesuheedida leabu Nasaretiin gabiissa Goojuur nea gwayeesha, “Ea Yesu, Orjeeda Dawdi, eaniyean bwaydanaan!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojuursa fugiga saang'aan nea geeyeesha, siinda, sirukusa ghoaraanya giijuureanda muuchi nea gwayeesha, “Ea Orjeeda Dawdi, eaniyean bwaydanaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawus Yesu ghamiinaada ak gwayeesha buuneeda, “Aguursiina.” Hean geeguursa siidida ng'oawiin nea geeyeesha, “Amiini uhuudaang'u ng'eada ak guwi gaguuru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwajaksa ng'eanyi hang'daanyi. Gootkweal ak gawa heeda Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoanyaash Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Gigasayi dasineey naaha?” Gwayeesha siidida ng'oawiin, “Ea Giinealshoocheanda, aniini geagasayi dabiikta daang'wearda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Una, ang'iing'i niihaapnyi masaweagaagu.” Miighoah gil gabiikta gicha Siidida ng'oawiin ghoang'wearda ghang'eat ak ghoang'waay naweeda ghwaat geeshta Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
